It sounds like you were bitten by a werewolf and contracted
lycanthropy (which causes you to turn into a wolf on occasion). When
you turn into a monster with no hands (like a wolf) you drop your
weapon, so remember to pick it up again before you move! If you prayed
after that point, your lycanthropy was probably cured. Next time you
get lycanthropy and turn into a wolf (or jackal/rat of you get bitten
by a werejackal or wererat), try typing "#monster" to use the form's
special property (I think the game suggests this when you first change
into a wolf?).

Actually, any time you change into another kind of monster you should
try the #monster command to see what it does; most monsters don't have
any special properties, but some have very useful ones.


